00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:08.500
Lesson 03. What is a grid bot.

2
00:00:08.500 --> 00:00:15.500
Educational content only. Not financial advice. Trading involves risk; you can lose money.

3
00:00:15.500 --> 00:00:33.794
Waiting orders inside a band you measured.

4
00:00:33.794 --> 00:00:45.040
Define a grid as limit orders waiting inside 24930 to 30331.

5
00:00:45.040 --> 00:00:50.589
Say which side of 27630 is the buy side in this picture.

6
00:00:50.589 --> 00:00:55.589
Refuse a sentence that calls the ten crosses a result.

7
00:00:55.589 --> 00:01:12.611
27630 was crossed 10 times. That is not a receipt.

8
00:01:12.611 --> 00:02:02.847
Buys below 27,630. Sells above it. Example only.

9
00:02:02.847 --> 00:02:13.811
The whole window stays on screen.

